    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo ikūmi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa ūbitana pye a Baisilaeli ūbawīla, “Bing'we Baisilaeli, degelekagi chiza mugiigwe a malange nī shilagīlo īsho nalīshihaya kū būtongi wing'we ī lelo. Shidimagi hangī mushimīzīle musho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu wise akabeeja ilagane hamò nise ū kū lūgūlū lwa Holebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lilagane lyenīlo ū SEEBA atabeegije na bakūlūgenji bise, alīyo akabeeja na bise benekīlī, pye a bose abo tūlī bapanga ī lelo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA akalūngalūnga ning'we bo hape hape kūfuma mu moto gwaligimaga mu lūgūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Ī likanza lyenīlo ū nene naalī nīmīīla ha gatī ying'we nū SEEBA kūlwa kūmuwīla ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA, nguno ng'walī ng'wagogoha ū moto, ng'ūlemeelwa ū kūlwegeela ū lūgūlū.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5:5",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kūlwegeela ū lūgūlū:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, kūja ū kū lūgūlū.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ū SEEBA ūlūngalūnga alīhaya gīkī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya kūlītūmamīla sagala sagala ī lina lya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako; nguno ū SEEBA atūng'wisaaba ose ose kūbiza ntūngīlīja ūyo akūlītūmamīlaga sagala sagala ī lina lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwizūkagwe ū lūshikū lwa Sabato ūlūlang'hane lwikale lwela, gīt'ūmo SEEBA Mulungu wako akūlagīīlile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūmamaga pyī ī milīmo yako, nī myatīla yako ūmalamaje mu shikū itandatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū lūshikū lwa mpungatī lwene Sabato ya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wako. Ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo yaya kūtūmama nīmo gose gose, ū bebe ng'wenekīlī, nūūlū ng'witūnja wako, nūūlū nshīke wako, nūūlū ntūmami wako ngosha nūūlū nkīma, nūūlū ng'ombe yako, nūūlū nzobe yako, pyī nūūlū mitugo jako jingī; nūūlū ngeni ūyo alī ha ng'wako. Ū ntūmami wako ngosha nūūlū nkīma, nang'hwe shiigelelile apandīke kwifuula gītī bebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izūkagwa gīkī nū bebe walī nsese mu sī ya Misili, na gīkī ū SEEBA Mulungu wako akagoloola nkono gwakwe, ūtūmamīla nkono gwa būdūla, ūkwīnja mo. Na lūūlū ū SEEBA Mulungu wako alagīlile kūlwizūkwa ū lūshikū lwa Sabato. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūjage so na noko, gīt'ūmo SEEBA Mulungu wako akūlagīīlīlile, ūpandīke kūlama shikū ningī, nī mihayo yako īkūbeelele ū mu sī īyo alīkwinha ū SEEBA Mulungu wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya kūbūlaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
