        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya kūfunya būkaanīji wa būlomolomo kūlwa nzenganwa ng'wiyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya kūng'wikūmva nke wa nzenganwa ng'wiyo, yaya nūūlū kwikūmva numba ya nzenganwa ng'wiyo, nūūlū ilaale lyakwe, nūūlū ntūmami wakwe ngosha nūūlū nkīma; nūūlū ng'ombe yakwe, nūūlū nzobe yakwe, nūūlū shikolo shingī shose shose sha nzenganwa ng'wiyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A malange genaya ū SEEBA akagahaya n'ilaka lya higūlya kū būtongi wa ibità lyose, aho balī ū kū lūgūlū ūlo lwaligimaga moto, lyalīho n'ilunde, na giiti shitaale. Atongegije mhayo gūngī hangī yaya. Hanuma ya henaho akagandīka ha mabalala ga mawe, ūninha nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ng'waliigwa ī lilaka kūfuma ū mu giiti kūnū ū lūgūlū lūkūligimaga moto, pye a batongeeji ba ng'anda jing'we na a banamhala bing'we bakiza ū kūlī nene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ūniwīla, “Ū SEEBA Mulungu wise watoolekejaga ī likūjo lyakwe nū būtaale wakwe, nī lilaka lyakwe twaliigwaga kūfuma ū mu moto. Ī lelo twabonaga gīkī gashi ū munhū ashikile kwikala alī mpanga nūūlū ūyombiwa na Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū ī gīsī, nibūlī tūshile kūcha? Nguno ū moto gwenūyū gūkūtūbūlaga nose; nū kwikala tūkūliigwaga gīko ī lilaka lya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wise tūkūcha nose! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno alīho munhū kī ū wa mīlī ūyo wabīta kwigwa ikanza lyose lyose ilaka lya ng'wa Mulungu mpanga akūlūngalūnganga kūfuma mu moto gīt'ūmo twigwīlaga bise gīkī, alīyo wikala mpanga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egeelaga ko ū bebe ūkīdegeleke chiza pyī īyo alīyīhaya ū SEEBA Mulungu wise. Hūna ūtūwīle būlī gwene ūyo alīkūwīla ū bebe ū SEEBA Mulungu wise; tūkūkwigwa tūshikīlīje.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
