        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho mulīniwīla ū SEEBA wang'wigwaga; na lūūlū ū SEEBA ūniwīla, “Nayigwaga īyo balīkūwīla a banhū benaba, īyo bīhayaga pyī ītūngīlīgije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni yabeelela ūlū nibabiza gīko gwa, ī ng'holò jabo jūbiza na logohano ū kūlī nene, būshidima ī shilagīlo shane pyī ī shikū gīkī ī mihayo ībaīle chiza, a boi benekīlī na a baana babo welelo bose!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū jaga ūkabawīle, “Shokagi kū maheema ging'we.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū bebe wīmīīle hihī nane aha nakwinhe pye a kahelele na a malange, nī shilagīlo īsho ūlabalange kūshidima ūlū bingīla ū mu sī īyo nalībinha kūbiza yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū ilang'hanagi ng'wīte gīt'ūmo SEEBA Mulungu wing'we alīmulagīīlīla; yaya kūgalūka nūūlū hado, kūja kū nkono gwa būlyo nūūlū gwa lūmoso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimīzīlagi mo ū mu nzīla jose ījo SEEBA Mulungu wing'we wamulagīīlaga, mupandīke kwikala mulī bapanga, nī mihayo īmuīle chiza, hama mubize na būlamu wa shikū ningī ū mu sī īyo mulayīdime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.5.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
